            <note corresp="#d710a-40-f1" n="2" xml:id="d710a-40-f1-content">
                <p>The discussion of this subject presumably centered on the report of the Combined
                    Transportation Committee which was circulated on July 21 as C. C. S. 897. See <ref target="#d1192">document No.
                        1192</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>.</p>
